the university of oxford is divided into  several colleges for simplicity's sake  think of them as harry potter houses  each college has its own living quarters  its own library its own dining hall etc  out of all the colleges that exist at  oxford this one the old souls college is  the most exclusive one you already must  hold a degree from oxford in order to  even qualify for application and if you  do qualify and apply you must go through  an examination process which has been  called the hardest exam in the world  there are even years when the college  doesn't admit anyone because no one was  deemed smart enough the exclusivity of  the college meant that it was often the  place where all the top brass of the  british empire came from in the late  19th and early 20th century the times  even called also's college a place for  running or helping to run the british  empire if you want to know more about  the history of the british empire and  its connection to the university of  oxford check out my video on it on the  mlaser history youtube channel
 

